{"id":"ABA-356","title":"Update bin/walk-delivery-plan — remove delegates_to from required node keys","description":"**What**
In `bin/walk-delivery-plan`, the `REQUIRED["node"]` tuple includes `"delegates_to"`. Since nodes no longer carry this field, remove it.

```python
# Before
REQUIRED = {
    "deliverable": ("layer", "id", "serves_kr", "maps_to"),
    "node": ("layer", "id", "type", "serves_kr", "maps_to", "completion.form", "delegates_to"),
}

# After
REQUIRED = {
    "deliverable": ("layer", "id", "serves_kr", "maps_to"),
    "node": ("layer", "id", "type", "serves_kr", "maps_to", "completion.form"),
}
```

Also remove `delegates_to` from the rendered manifest output in `render_text()` (the `delegates_to: {i['delegates_to']}` line) and from the JSON output structure.

